{"seq":2,"slug":"word-representations","title":"词向量表示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/natural-language-processing/nlp-foundations/word-representations","wordCount":2145,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"词向量表示\">词向量表示</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>词向量表示是 NLP 的基石——它解决了一个根本性问题：如何将离散的文本符号转换为连续的数值向量，使其能够被数学模型处理。从最早的 One-Hot 编码到当今的上下文化词向量，表示学习的每一次突破都推动了 NLP 整体能力的飞跃。词向量的核心假设是分布式语义假说：词的含义由其上下文决定，出现在相似上下文中的词具有相似的语义。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[离散符号] --&gt; B[One-Hot]&#10;    B --&gt; C[分布式表示]&#10;    C --&gt; D[静态词向量]&#10;    C --&gt; E[上下文词向量]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[Word2Vec]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[GloVe]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[FastText]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[ELMo]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[BERT]&#10;    E --&gt; E3[GPT]\">graph LR\n    A[离散符号] --&gt; B[One-Hot]\n    B --&gt; C[分布式表示]\n    C --&gt; D[静态词向量]\n    C --&gt; E[上下文词向量]\n    D --&gt; D1[Word2Vec]\n    D --&gt; D2[GloVe]\n    D --&gt; D3[FastText]\n    E --&gt; E1[ELMo]\n    E --&gt; E2[BERT]\n    E --&gt; E3[GPT]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表示方法</th>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>是否上下文相关</th>\n<th>训练数据需求</th>\n<th>代表模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>One-Hot</td>\n<td>词表大小（万级）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>无需训练</td>\n<td>传统方法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TF-IDF</td>\n<td>词表大小</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>文档集合</td>\n<td>信息检索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Word2Vec</td>\n<td>100-300</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>大规模语料</td>\n<td>CBOW/Skip-gram</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GloVe</td>\n<td>100-300</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>共现矩阵</td>\n<td>Stanford GloVe</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FastText</td>\n<td>100-300</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>大规模语料</td>\n<td>Facebook FastText</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ELMo</td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>大规模语料</td>\n<td>BiLSTM LM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BERT</td>\n<td>768/1024</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>大规模语料</td>\n<td>Transformer Encoder</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>One-Hot 编码将每个词表示为一个维度等于词表大小的稀疏向量，其中只有对应位置为 1。这种表示有两个致命缺陷：维度灾难（词表大小通常在数万到数十万级别）和语义缺失（任意两个词的向量都是正交的，无法度量相似度）。分布式词向量的出现正是为了解决这些问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"word2vec-与分布式词向量\">Word2Vec 与分布式词向量</h2><p>Word2Vec 是 2013 年 Google 提出的革命性模型，它证明了简单的浅层神经网络就能学习到高质量的词向量。Word2Vec 包含两种训练架构：CBOW（Continuous Bag of Words）和 Skip-gram。</p>\n<p>CBOW 用上下文词预测中心词。给定窗口大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>，模型将中心词周围 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 个上下文词的嵌入向量取平均，通过一个线性层和 softmax 预测中心词。Skip-gram 则反过来，用中心词预测上下文中的每个词。实践表明，Skip-gram 在小数据集和低频词上表现更好，而 CBOW 训练更快。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class SkipGram(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, vocab_size: int, embed_dim: int):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.center_embed = nn.Embedding(vocab_size, embed_dim)&#10;        self.context_embed = nn.Embedding(vocab_size, embed_dim)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, center: torch.Tensor, context: torch.Tensor) -&gt; torch.Tensor:&#10;        center_vec = self.center_embed(center)&#10;        context_vec = self.context_embed(context)&#10;        return torch.sum(center_vec * context_vec, dim=-1)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SkipGram</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, vocab_size: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, embed_dim: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.center_embed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Embedding(vocab_size, embed_dim)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.context_embed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Embedding(vocab_size, embed_dim)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, center: torch.Tensor, context: torch.Tensor) -> torch.Tensor:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        center_vec </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.center_embed(center)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        context_vec </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.context_embed(context)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.sum(center_vec </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> context_vec, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>训练优化是 Word2Vec 成功的关键。完整的 softmax 在大词表上计算代价极高，负采样（Negative Sampling）通过将多分类问题转化为二分类来大幅降低计算量——对于每个正样本（真实的中心词-上下文词对），随机采样 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个负样本（随机配对的词对）。采样概率通常按词频的 3/4 次方加权，避免高频词主导训练。层次 Softmax 是另一种优化方案，利用哈夫曼树将计算复杂度从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(V)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log V)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>Word2Vec 学到的词向量展现出迷人的代数性质。最著名的例子是&quot;king - man + woman ≈ queen&quot;，这说明词向量空间中的方向编码了语义关系。这种线性类比关系不仅存在于性别维度，还存在于国家-首都、动词时态、比较级-最高级等多种语义维度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"glove-与全局统计信息\">GloVe 与全局统计信息</h2><p>GloVe（Global Vectors for Word Representation）是 Stanford 在 2014 年提出的词向量模型，它的核心洞察是：词向量应该同时捕捉局部上下文信息和全局共现统计信息。Word2Vec 通过滑动窗口隐式捕捉了局部共现关系，但没有显式利用全局统计信息；而传统的共现矩阵分解（如 LSA）只关注全局统计。GloVe 将二者统一。</p>\n<p>GloVe 首先构建词-词共现矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 表示词 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 出现在词 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 上下文窗口中的次数。然后优化目标使得两个词向量的点积等于其共现次数的对数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>V</mi></munderover><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>w</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J = \\sum_{i,j=1}^{V} f(X_{ij})(w_i^T \\tilde{w}_j + b_i + \\tilde{b}_j - \\log X_{ij})^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.2421em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2174em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1502em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是权重函数，用于限制极高频共现对损失的贡献。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X_{ij} &lt; x_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>0.75</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x) = (x/x_{max})^{0.75}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.75</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；否则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x) = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。这确保了 &quot;the&quot;、&quot;a&quot; 等超高频词不会主导训练过程。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[大规模语料] --&gt; B[构建共现矩阵 X]&#10;    B --&gt; C[初始化词向量 w, w̃]&#10;    C --&gt; D[加权最小二乘优化]&#10;    D --&gt; E{收敛?}&#10;    E --&gt;|否| D&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[最终词向量 = w + w̃]\">graph TD\n    A[大规模语料] --&gt; B[构建共现矩阵 X]\n    B --&gt; C[初始化词向量 w, w̃]\n    C --&gt; D[加权最小二乘优化]\n    D --&gt; E{收敛?}\n    E --&gt;|否| D\n    E --&gt;|是| F[最终词向量 = w + w̃]</pre><p>FastText 是 Facebook 对 Word2Vec 的扩展，关键创新是引入子词信息。每个词被表示为其所有 n-gram 子词向量的和。例如 &quot;where&quot; 的 3-gram 子词为 &quot;&lt;wh&quot;、&quot;whe&quot;、&quot;her&quot;、&quot;ere&quot;、&quot;re&gt;&quot;（其中 &quot;&lt;&quot; 和 &quot;&gt;&quot; 是边界标记）。这使得 FastText 能够为训练时未见过的词（OOV）生成合理的向量，对于形态丰富的语言（如芬兰语、土耳其语）效果尤为显著。</p>\n<h2 id=\"上下文化词向量\">上下文化词向量</h2><p>静态词向量的根本局限是一词一向量——&quot;bank&quot; 在 &quot;river bank&quot; 和 &quot;bank account&quot; 中获得相同的向量，无法区分多义词的不同含义。上下文化词向量彻底解决了这一问题：每个词的向量取决于其在当前句子中的上下文。</p>\n<p>ELMo（Embeddings from Language Models）是上下文化词向量的先驱。它使用双向 LSTM 语言模型，将前向和后向语言模型在每一层的隐状态拼接，作为该层的词表示。最终的 ELMo 向量是所有层表示的加权和，权重通过任务特定的 softmax 学习。不同层捕捉不同层次的语言信息——底层更接近词法和句法，高层更偏向语义。</p>\n<p>BERT 将上下文化表示推向了新高度。基于 Transformer 编码器架构，BERT 通过掩码语言模型（MLM）和下一句预测（NSP）两个预训练任务学习深层双向表示。MLM 随机遮盖输入中 15% 的 token，模型需要根据上下文预测被遮盖的词；NSP 判断两个句子是否在原文中相邻。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>静态词向量</th>\n<th>ELMo</th>\n<th>BERT</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>上下文敏感</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型架构</td>\n<td>浅层网络</td>\n<td>BiLSTM</td>\n<td>Transformer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预训练方式</td>\n<td>无监督（预测上下文）</td>\n<td>语言模型</td>\n<td>MLM + NSP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多义词处理</td>\n<td>无法区分</td>\n<td>基于上下文</td>\n<td>基于上下文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微调方式</td>\n<td>固定向量</td>\n<td>特征提取</td>\n<td>整体微调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参数规模</td>\n<td>~百万</td>\n<td>~百万</td>\n<td>亿级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>GPT 系列模型采用自回归语言模型范式，使用 Transformer 解码器架构，从左到右逐词生成。虽然 GPT 的词向量也是上下文化的，但由于其单向特性，每个词只能&quot;看到&quot;左侧的上下文。GPT 和 BERT 代表了两种不同的预训练哲学——生成式和理解式——二者在下游任务中各有优势。</p>\n<h2 id=\"词向量评估与应用\">词向量评估与应用</h2><p>词向量的质量评估分为内部评估和外部评估。内部评估直接衡量向量空间的性质，包括词类比任务（&quot;king - man + woman = ?&quot;）、词相似度任务（与人工标注的词对相似度排名比较，如 WS-353、SimLex-999 数据集）和聚类可视化（用 t-SNE 或 UMAP 降维后观察语义聚类）。外部评估则在下游任务上衡量词向量的实际效果——用预训练词向量初始化模型在分类、NER、情感分析等任务上的性能提升。</p>\n<p>词向量偏差是近年来备受关注的问题。训练语料中的社会偏见会被编码到词向量中——例如 &quot;man:computer_programmer :: woman:homemaker&quot; 这样的类比关系反映了性别偏见。研究者提出了多种去偏方法，包括后处理投影（将偏见方向的分量去除）和对抗训练（在训练过程中惩罚偏见模式）。</p>\n<p>在实际应用中，词向量的使用策略取决于任务和数据量。数据充足时，随机初始化并在任务数据上训练通常足够；数据有限时，使用预训练词向量初始化可以显著提升性能；在 BERT 时代，更常见的做法是直接微调预训练模型，而非使用固定的词向量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((词向量表示))&#10;    离散表示&#10;      One-Hot编码&#10;      词袋模型&#10;      TF-IDF&#10;    静态词向量&#10;      Word2Vec CBOW/Skip-gram&#10;      GloVe 全局共现&#10;      FastText 子词信息&#10;    上下文词向量&#10;      ELMo BiLSTM&#10;      BERT Transformer编码器&#10;      GPT Transformer解码器&#10;    评估与应用&#10;      词类比任务&#10;      词相似度评测&#10;      偏差检测与去偏\">mindmap\n  root((词向量表示))\n    离散表示\n      One-Hot编码\n      词袋模型\n      TF-IDF\n    静态词向量\n      Word2Vec CBOW/Skip-gram\n      GloVe 全局共现\n      FastText 子词信息\n    上下文词向量\n      ELMo BiLSTM\n      BERT Transformer编码器\n      GPT Transformer解码器\n    评估与应用\n      词类比任务\n      词相似度评测\n      偏差检测与去偏</pre><ul>\n<li>词向量将离散文本符号映射为连续数值向量，是 NLP 的基础表示技术</li>\n<li>Word2Vec 通过浅层神经网络学习分布式表示，Skip-gram 和 CBOW 是两种互补的架构</li>\n<li>GloVe 统一了局部上下文和全局共现统计，FastText 引入子词信息处理 OOV 问题</li>\n<li>上下文化词向量（ELMo、BERT、GPT）解决了多义词问题，每个词的表示随上下文动态变化</li>\n<li>词向量评估包括内部评估（类比、相似度）和外部评估（下游任务性能），还需关注偏差问题</li>\n<li>在大模型时代，直接微调预训练模型已成为主流范式，但理解词向量的发展历程有助于把握 NLP 的技术脉络</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"词向量表示","id":"词向量表示"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Word2Vec 与分布式词向量","id":"word2vec-与分布式词向量"},{"level":2,"text":"GloVe 与全局统计信息","id":"glove-与全局统计信息"},{"level":2,"text":"上下文化词向量","id":"上下文化词向量"},{"level":2,"text":"词向量评估与应用","id":"词向量评估与应用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"文本预处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/natural-language-processing/nlp-foundations/text-preprocessing"},"next":{"title":"语言模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/natural-language-processing/nlp-foundations/language-models"}}